      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 3.6,
          "en": "Now that we're outputting a list of tickets here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.6,
          "end": 7.26,
          "en": "let's make sure we output more than just this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.26,
          "end": 12.26,
          "en": "dummy fallback text, or that default text for every ticket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 15.69,
          "en": "And for that, attached, you'll find an updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.69,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "ticket component HTML file, which you should use to replace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 24.21,
          "en": "your ticket component HTML file with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "It's not finished yet, we'll work on it;",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 29.49,
          "en": "it contains some dummy code and some placeholders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.49,
          "end": 33.69,
          "en": "but it's a starting point, and you should use it to replace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.69,
          "end": 37.47,
          "en": "your ticket component HTML file so that we can continue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.47,
          "end": 40.62,
          "en": "working on that ticket component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 44.13,
          "en": "and we can make sure that we output the actual ticket",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.13,
          "end": 45.003,
          "en": "data there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 49.41,
          "en": "Now, in that attached ticket component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.41,
          "end": 52.62,
          "en": "you'll see some conditional statements, which at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.62,
          "end": 55.65,
          "en": "don't contain any real conditions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.65,
          "end": 58.8,
          "en": "Instead, this will always be true, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.8,
          "end": 61.02,
          "en": "which doesn't make too much sense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "but we'll work on that soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "I already want to note though, that at if, just like at four",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 72.6,
          "en": "will only work if you're using Angular 17 or later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 76.26,
          "en": "In older Angular versions, this would not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.26,
          "end": 79.86,
          "en": "and you would instead have to use the ngIf directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.86,
          "end": 83.67,
          "en": "which I also covered earlier in the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.67,
          "end": 87,
          "en": "I'll not repeat it here, but you should know that this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87,
          "end": 91.26,
          "en": "requires Angular 17 or later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 94.56,
          "en": "Now, with that ticket component HTML file added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.56,
          "end": 97.8,
          "en": "we have to make sure that we get the ticket data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 100.32,
          "en": "for the ticket that should be output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.32,
          "end": 101.943,
          "en": "into that ticket component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.05,
          "end": 105.42,
          "en": "Put in other words, we need an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.42,
          "end": 107.253,
          "en": "or multiple inputs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 111.78,
          "en": "And here, I'll actually work with one input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.78,
          "end": 114.66,
          "en": "and I'll name it ticket or data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.66,
          "end": 116.58,
          "en": "Let's maybe go with data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.58,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "And you can now either turn this property into an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 122.133,
          "en": "by adding the @input decorator,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 126.063,
          "en": "or by using the input function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.2,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "Then you'll get such a input signal, and that's what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 134.16,
          "en": "I'll do here, but you could of course use either approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "as you learned before in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "Now, I also will set this to be a required input here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 144.45,
          "end": 147.51,
          "en": "And I want to let TypeScript know which kind of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.51,
          "end": 148.563,
          "en": "we'll receive here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.46,
          "end": 152.82,
          "en": "And here, I expect to get such a ticket from my own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 154.92000000000002,
          "en": "ticket model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.92000000000002,
          "end": 157.353,
          "en": "So, that interface which we defined there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 163.47,
          "en": "I expect to get an object of that shape as a required input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 167.73,
          "en": "for this data property on that ticket component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.73,
          "end": 170.85,
          "en": "And that then allows me to go to the ticket component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.85,
          "end": 174.81,
          "en": "HTML file, and then there, we can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.81,
          "end": 179.81,
          "en": "replace the title here with data executed as function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 179.94,
          "end": 183.333,
          "en": "since it's a signal .title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.13,
          "end": 188.37,
          "en": "I'll keep this condition here as it is for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 193.11,
          "en": "but then further down here, the text should be replaced",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 193.11,
          "end": 196.794,
          "en": "with some string interpolation where we use data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.794,
          "end": 198.273,
          "en": ".request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.47,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "Of course, all the executing data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 203.253,
          "en": "since it's still a signal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 208.987,
          "en": "And then here for this last, ifCheck I'll check ifData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 208.987,
          "end": 211.923,
          "en": ".status is equal to open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 213.32999999999998,
          "end": 216.72,
          "en": "Because I only want to show this mark as completed button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 220.86,
          "en": "here if it is an open ticket, not one that has been marked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.86,
          "end": 221.97,
          "en": "as closed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.97,
          "end": 224.373,
          "en": "So as completed, you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.51,
          "end": 227.13,
          "en": "And that's it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 227.13,
          "end": 230.61,
          "en": "Now back in the tickets component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.61,
          "end": 235.61,
          "en": "we should set this data property and bind it dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 235.92000000000002,
          "end": 239.373,
          "en": "to that ticket, which we get here in the loop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.51,
          "end": 244.86,
          "en": "So, every ticket is passed into its ticket component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 244.86,
          "end": 248.34,
          "en": "as a value for this data input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 248.34,
          "end": 250.8,
          "en": "And with that, if I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 253.5,
          "en": "and I enter some data here and click submit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.5,
          "end": 256.74,
          "en": "you see that's being output here and the title is also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 256.74,
          "end": 260.973,
          "en": "being output here, though the styling looks a bit off here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 262.2,
          "end": 265.65,
          "en": "And that's why attached, you also find a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 265.65,
          "end": 269.04,
          "en": "ticket.component.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 269.04,
          "end": 271.41,
          "en": "which you should use to replace your",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.41,
          "end": 274.113,
          "en": "ticket.component.css file with.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 276.39,
          "end": 278.52,
          "en": "With that done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 278.52,
          "end": 280.53,
          "en": "if you try this again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 280.53,
          "end": 282.693,
          "en": "the styling should look much better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 284.13,
          "end": 287.19,
          "en": "Please note that clicking this here won't do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 287.19,
          "end": 290.22,
          "en": "yet though, but we'll soon make sure that these tickets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 290.22,
          "end": 292.98,
          "en": "can be collapsed or expanded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 292.98,
          "end": 296.1,
          "en": "But we're outputting the data and that's looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 296.1,
          "end": 298.923,
          "en": "Now we can enhance these tickets further.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
